research/audit/wave8-judge-adjudications.jsonl:4:{"id":"thm-continuous-image-of-a-compact-set-r","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","context_sha256":"434414bf9332825d9963055bf3753c8e4c264fa2dce4da64b10fc6854b6f2d76","outcome":"confirmed_nonfatal","item_sha256":"a5d7a5f1807ae9e80a7ae3a80a1e03a7dec29925403525323af0e1addf3c9177","verdict_item_sha256":"d46870f38f1423f0ef5473270dc48625a5038f14af0a54310d8b99bada322908","adjudicator":"audit-alpha (gpt-5.6-sol, xhigh; owner-delegated)","at":"2026-08-09T08:03:46Z","note":"Terra identifies a literal editorial tension, not a mathematical contradiction. The current theorem is a signpost saying the duplication 'is acknowledged in exactly one place' and points to lem-real-and-metric-notions-agree; that lemma says verbatim, 'This item is the single place in the library where that duplication is acknowledged,' meaning the single formal dictionary that reconciles the two vocabularies. The theorem, hypotheses, and proof are unaffected. Treating the signpost itself as a second formal reconciliation is at most a localized wording overstatement, hence nonfatal and uneditable at A8."}
