research/audit/wave9-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-6070-          "claim": "In particular $t$ is continuous at every irrational, where $\\omega_{t} = 0$, and discontinuous at every rational, where $\\omega_{t} = t > 0$; the numbers above are the sizes of those failures. [step 2.1, A1, L1] ∎",
