research/audit/wave9-refuter-tasks/ex-thomae-values-and-oscillation-computed.md-55-   $\omega_{t}$ is $1$ at every integer, $1/2$ at every half-integer that is not
research/audit/wave9-refuter-tasks/ex-thomae-values-and-oscillation-computed.md-56-   an integer, and $0$ at every irrational.
