research/audit/wave9-refuter-tasks/thm-froda.md-1647-[L6] $|u| \ge 0$, $|u - v| \le |u| + |v|$, and if $0 \le u \le M$ and $0 \le v \le M$ then $|u - v| \le M$ ([[lem-of-abs-value]]).
