research/audit/wave9-dispatch/audit-refuter-a6-lem-oscillation-superlevel-sets-are-closed.prompt.md-127-**Given:** $A \subseteq \mathbb{R}$, a function $f : A \to \mathbb{R}$, and a real $\varepsilon > 0$.
