research/audit/wave9-dispatch/audit-refuter-a6-thm-discontinuity-set-is-f-sigma.prompt.md-1857-
research/audit/wave9-dispatch/audit-refuter-a6-thm-discontinuity-set-is-f-sigma.prompt.md:1858:[L4] For every real $\varepsilon > 0$ there is a closed $G \subseteq \mathbb{R}$ with $\{x \in [a,b] : \omega_f(x) \ge \varepsilon\} = [a,b] \cap G$ ([[lem-oscillation-superlevel-sets-are-closed]]).
research/audit/wave9-dispatch/audit-refuter-a6-thm-discontinuity-set-is-f-sigma.prompt.md-1859-
